    "bodyText": "/\nJoshuah's Workspace\n/\nWorkspace\nGet free credits\nInvite Team\nBack to Home\nTeam\nBilling & Subscription\nWorkspace\nUsage Reports\nProfile\nIntegrations\nConnectors\nSkills\nAPI Keys\nWorkspace Settings\nWorkspace Logo\nShown in the sidebar and anywhere your workspace appears. Click it to change — square PNG, JPG, or WEBP.\nWorkspace Name\nVisible to everyone in your workspace.\nSave\nShare new designs with the workspace\nEveryone in the workspace can view a design as soon as it is created. Creators can still change who has access on any individual design.\nSingle Sign-On (SSO)\nSSO is available on Business and Enterprise plans. Upgrade to configure SAML or OIDC for your workspace.\nUpgrade to Business\nDedicated Slack or Microsoft Teams Channel\nDedicated support is available on Business and Enterprise plans. Need a technical account manager? We're here to help. Learn more.\nUpgrade to Business"
