    "bodyText": "/\nJoshuah's Workspace\n/\nConnectors\nGet free credits\nInvite Team\nBack to Home\nTeam\nBilling & Subscription\nWorkspace\nUsage Reports\nProfile\nIntegrations\nConnectors\nSkills\nAPI Keys\nConnectors\nAdd Custom\nConnect external services via MCP (Model Context Protocol). When enabled, the AI assistant can call tools exposed by these connectors to pull in context from your other apps.\nGranola\nConnect to Granola to pull meeting notes and context into your designs.\nConnect\nNotion\nConnect to Notion to pull pages, databases, and content into your designs.\nConnect\nLinear\nConnect to Linear to pull issues, projects, and roadmaps into your designs.\nConnect\nMiro\nConnect to Miro to pull boards, frames, and visual context into your designs.\nConnect\nJira\nConnect to Jira to pull project context into your designs.\nConnect\nMobbin\nConnect to Mobbin to pull real-world UI design patterns into your designs.\nConnect"
  },
